# Archive Output Location

All QAGRedo **`.tar`** and **`.tar.gz`** artifacts (and their **`.sha256`** sidecars) belong in:

**`/data/tyewhong/qagredo/`**

## Scripts (defaults)

- `scripts/make_qagredo_bundle.sh` → `QAGREDO_ARCHIVE_DIR` (default above)
- `scripts/make_offline_tarballs.sh` → `QAGREDO_OFFLINE_OUT` (defaults to same dir)
- `scripts/save_vllm_qwen35_image.sh` → `OUT_DIR` / `QAGREDO_ARCHIVE_DIR`

Set in `.env`: `QAGREDO_ARCHIVE_DIR=/data/tyewhong/qagredo`

## Agent behavior

- Never leave `.tar` / `.tar.gz` in `/home/tyewhong/qagredo/` or `offline_out/` after building; move or write directly to `/data/tyewhong/qagredo/`.
- When giving manual `docker save` or `tar czf` commands, use `/data/tyewhong/qagredo/` as the output directory.
- `.zip` archives are not covered by this rule (may live next to datasets, e.g. pathfinder).
